        charTransformSpawnOn: {fileID: 0}
        Sentences:
        - Hey kidddd...
        - You got the money??? Wow.
        - I never thought you would save enough, let alone this quickly!
        - Im sorry son, but the car is gone.
        - Tony bought it for his son as gift for getting his drivers license.
        - I hate that kid... I should have never sold it to him. That car is going
          to get written off anyday...
        - But I owed Tony a favour so what was I to do?
        - Sorry kid.
