        charTransformSpawnOn: {fileID: 466499110}
        Sentences:
        - '"There you are! I was starting to think you''d wrapped yourself around
          a lamppost!"'
        - "...\n\nWait... you\u2019re back already? "
        - 'You actually did it? They hired you?

          You were the quickest
          they have ever seen?'
        - "Maybe there\u2019s hope for you yet."
        - "Don\u2019t let it get to your head though.  \nThis doesn\u2019t mean you\u2019re
          getting out of doing the dishes."
        - "Still\u2026 I\u2019m proud of you, son.  \r\nJust keep your eyes on the
          road! \n"
        - "And don\u2019t drive like a maniac, okay?"
        - And maybe if you have some money leftover after paying your rent, you can
          set it aside for that dream car of yours?
